 - 2026-06-01: Prepare the headline re-freeze PACKAGE for the operator (gated on exp3680 G1-rigor confirmed) — extend scripts/reproduce_fover_headline.py to also compute the dependency-aware AUROC + CI, draft the updated CI-workflow assertion bounds, and emit an operator checklist for the north-star sec-1 re-freeze — PREPARE-ONLY; the frozen 0.9131 stays frozen and the agent never edits north-star.md or triggers the CI run (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: refreeze_package_ready_for_operator_frozen_headline_unchanged; results/experiment_3681_g2_reproducer_prep_operator_refreeze_package.json
 - 2026-06-02: Diagnose + try to CLOSE the discrimination-vs-selection gap (exp3672: ensemble AUROC 0.93 but selection < SC) — is the decoupling fixable for an energy verifier via per-question normalization / a within-question ranking calibration / a stronger self-certainty baseline (arXiv:2502.18581), or is it fundamental as arXiv:2512.23067 suggests? (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: selection_gap_fundamental_no_fix_beats_sc_discrimination_decoupled_as_2512_23067; results/experiment_3682_discrimination_vs_selection_gap.json
 - 2026-06-02: Harden the shipped detector's CODE operating point — exp3671 ships but code AUROC 0.5 (no signal) + ECE 0.37; on the balanced code corpus (exp3658) test whether the .336-validated dependency-aware weighting transfers to code discrimination and re-calibrate the code operating point, or honestly document code as math-only (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: code_remains_math_only_detector_scoped_honestly; results/experiment_3683_detector_code_operating_point.json
+- 2026-06-02: Adversarial product re-baseline vs self-certainty (arXiv:2502.18581) — the second-pair-of-eyes detector's 'beats confidence' claim used PLAIN model confidence; re-measure whether the ensemble adds value OVER the stronger free self-certainty signal, on math (FoVer) and the balanced code corpus — is the product value robust or an artifact of a weak baseline? (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: ensemble_adds_value_over_self_certainty_product_value_robust; results/experiment_3684_product_value_vs_self_certainty.json
